                <note rend="inline" type="source">311.6124/74: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Commissioner at Riga</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Young</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic"
                        >to the Secretary of State</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Riga</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1920-08-07T07:00:00+01:36"><hi rendition="#italic">August 7,
                                1920—7 a.m.</hi></date><lb/>[Received 11:21
                    a.m.]</dateline></opener>
                <p>96. Esthonian Minister of Foreign Affairs informs me that despite repeated
                    requests no reply has been received from Moscow regarding deportees.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Young</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
